From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Breunig <christian@breunig.cc>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 09:26:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mlx5: build on kernels where xsk_buff_get_metadata takes
 options

Linux 6.18.y stable backported upstream commit a6e4b9a6deb9 ("xsk: honor
XDP_TX_METADATA in zero-copy path"), which adds the descriptor options
to xsk_buff_get_metadata(). OFED still calls it with two arguments and
the mlx5 XSK TX path fails to compile.

Add a HAVE_XSK_BUFF_GET_METADATA_OPTIONS feature test and a backport
patch passing the descriptor options, matching the in-tree driver.
---
 ...0-BACKPORT-xsk_buff_get_metadata-options.patch | 15 +++++++++++++++
 compat/config/rdma.m4                             |  8 ++++++++
 2 files changed, 23 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 backports/0380-BACKPORT-xsk_buff_get_metadata-options.patch

diff --git a/backports/0380-BACKPORT-xsk_buff_get_metadata-options.patch b/backports/0380-BACKPORT-xsk_buff_get_metadata-options.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3c83cde
--- /dev/null
+++ b/backports/0380-BACKPORT-xsk_buff_get_metadata-options.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/mellanox/mlx5/core/en/xsk/tx.c
++++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/mellanox/mlx5/core/en/xsk/tx.c
+@@ -119,8 +119,12 @@ bool mlx5e_xsk_tx(struct mlx5e_xdpsq *sq
+ #endif
+ 		xdptxd.len = desc.len;
+ #ifdef HAVE_XSK_TX_METADATA_OPS
++#ifdef HAVE_XSK_BUFF_GET_METADATA_OPTIONS
++		meta = xsk_buff_get_metadata(pool, desc.addr, desc.options);
++#else
+ 		meta = xsk_buff_get_metadata(pool, desc.addr);
+ #endif
++#endif
+ 
+ #ifdef HAVE_XSK_BUFF_ALLOC
+ 		xsk_buff_raw_dma_sync_for_device(pool, xdptxd.dma_addr, xdptxd.len);
diff --git a/compat/config/rdma.m4 b/compat/config/rdma.m4
index f9a185a..070595c 100644
--- a/compat/config/rdma.m4
+++ b/compat/config/rdma.m4
@@ -4721,6 +4721,14 @@ MLNX_RDMA_TEST_CASE(HAVE_DEVL_RATE_NODES_DESTROY_UNSETS_PARENT, [devl_rate_nodes
 		return 0;
 	])
 
+	MLNX_RDMA_TEST_CASE(HAVE_XSK_BUFF_GET_METADATA_OPTIONS, [xsk_buff_get_metadata has options parameter], [
+		#include <net/xdp_sock_drv.h>
+	],[
+		xsk_buff_get_metadata(NULL, 0, 0);
+
+		return 0;
+	])
+
 	MLNX_RDMA_TEST_CASE(HAVE_IRQ_UPDATE_AFFINITY_HINT, [irq_set_affinity_and_hint is defined], [
 		#include <linux/interrupt.h>
 	],[
-- 
2.39.5

